99, 2011-2012 DHS and 2005 EIS and 2006, 2016 MICS.","mortality":"Life expectancy at birth and age pattern of mortality based on: (a) registered deaths by age and sex available through 2019; (b) The demographic impact of AIDS has been factored into the mortality estimates; (c) estimates using HIV/AIDS model life tables and estimates of under-five mortality (5q0) and adult mortality (45q15) with UNAIDS estimates of adult HIV prevalence, and ART coverage for children and adults.","migration":"International migration based on: (a) information on foreign-born populations from censuses and registers from major countries of destination; (b) estimates derived as the differences between overall population growth and natural increase; (c) UNHCR statistics on the number of refugees in the main countries of asylum."}},"forecastRange":{"startYear":2024,"adjusted":false,"lower80":[31869610,32508614,33126354,33715494,34306960,34902363,35467743,36033889,36607826,37195363,37788829,38340734,38835366,39320285,39816086,40308419,40858096,41464779,42062355,42629419,43132509,43620699,44119419,44651617,45047205,45401651,45911596,46447592,46864714,47135913,47472270,47867632,48223704,48583241,48987080,49372543,49738329,50130351,50497215,50716772,51002909,51387125,51865964,52431119,52909931,53435549,53848772,54162930,54368307,54577219,54813221,54950849,55117729,55276168,55500109,55691232,55976711,56273664,56430588,56650721,56970179,57131714,57298424,57509522,57518757,57552714,57610968,57733525,57926800,58262519,58373527,58201689,58313708,58532638,58583841,58590530,58669624],"upper80":[31999506,32916047,33857960,34818204,35815566,36854089,37914193,39008859,40181557,41393421,42598970,43843808,45111023,46428749,47823026,49247681,50698100,52157110,53595327,55052295,56527666,58011475,59527673,61138388,62818743,64467270,66188108,67990033,69773529,71594467,73419311,75197481,76930233,78768477,80823723,82892039,84809144,86651711,88541678,90457430,92508258,94824198,97224422,99780264,102259835,10445404